<title>GERMANY: Textron to buy Kloeckner unit. [CORRECTED 17:43 GMT]</title>
<headline>Textron to buy Kloeckner unit. [CORRECTED 17:43 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Textron Inc, the diversified industrial group based in Providence, Rhode Island, has agreed to buy Germany's Kautex-Werke AG for 468 million marks, Kautex parent Kloeckner-Werke said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal is retroactive to October 1, 1996 (corrects date from &quot;January 1, 1996&quot;) and must still be approved by anti-trust authorities in the United States and Europe.</p>
<p>The final transaction is expected to take place at the beginning of 1997, Kloeckner said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- William Boston, Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
